<h2 id="bottom-line">Bottom Line</h2>

<p>The Stuff Your E-Reader event running through August 8 is a genuine no-catch giveaway: 100+ free indie ebooks, yours to keep, with no limits and no subscription required. Grab the books you want before the window closes, prefer the Kobo EPUB versions when you can, and convert anything Kindle-only with Calibre so your free library stays readable on every device you own.</p>

<p>Free is only the first half of the deal. The second half is format freedom — and that is exactly what EPUB was built for. A library of DRM-free EPUB files, organized in Calibre, will still be yours to read ten years from now, no matter which store, promotion, or e-reader comes and goes in the meantime.</p>
